	"Author": "XxHarvzBackxX",
	"Description": "[center][size=6][b][u]Airstrike[/u][/b][/size]\n<br />[size=2]This mod adds an item that allows you to call an airstrike on any outdoor location.\n<br />\n<br />[/size]\n<br />You can craft Airstrike Flares after reaching Combat level 8.\n<br />When holding an Airstrike Flare, right click anywhere in any outdoor location to call an airstrike, and after about 15 seconds, the marked area will be decimated as the Ferngill Armed Forces fulfil your strike request! Just make sure you aren't near the strike zone when the bombs hit, as they pack quite a punch!\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />[size=4][b][u]Installation\n<br />[/u][/b][/size][/center][b]      \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF\uFEFF   \uFEFF1. [/b]Download the mod files from the Nexus files tab.\n<br />[b]   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF2.[/b] Drag them into your Stardew Mods folder.\n<br />[b]   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF   \uFEFF3. [/b]Install Json Assets and all of its dependencies from this mod's requirements tab.\n<br />\n<br />[url=https://github.com/XxHarvzBackxX/airstrike]Source code.[/url]",
